  "text": "## PART 1: Daily Branch Operations  \n### Opening Procedures (09:00 AM)  \n**30 Minutes Before Opening:**  \n1. **Physical Security**\n- [ ] Check entrance/exit doors locked\n- [ ] Disarm alarm system (code: [SECURITY CODE])\n- [ ] Check for any signs of break-in\n- [ ] Turn on lights and CCTV  \n2. **Cash Handling**\n- [ ] Count cash in vault (report to manager)\n- [ ] Verify amount matches overnight report\n- [ ] Load cash drawers for tellers (standard: £5,000 per drawer)\n- [ ] Record drawer assignments\n- [ ] Lock vault  \n3. **System Startup**\n- [ ] Boot up computers\n- [ ] Wait for systems to come online\n- [ ] Check system status dashboard (green = ready)\n- [ ] Log into teller systems with credentials\n- [ ] Verify ability to access customer accounts  \n4. **Branch Readiness**\n- [ ] Check waiting area (seating, magazines, temperature)\n- [ ] Verify reception area is clean\n- [ ] Check bathrooms are clean and stocked\n- [ ] Verify appointment calendar is loaded\n- [ ] Confirm staff are at their desks by 08:50 AM  \n**9:00 AM - Ready for Customers**  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 3/25",
  "domain": "banking_communications",
